WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.895
The program's rule: discovery
fills the configuration database,

2
00:00:03.895 --> 00:00:08.538
but the authoritative naming and addressing
record decides what an asset is.

3
00:00:08.538 --> 00:00:13.074
When they disagree, the database is
wrong, and the gap is a finding.

4
00:00:13.074 --> 00:00:15.637
This matters for patching and evidence.

5
00:00:15.637 --> 00:00:19.887
A missing asset is never patched,
while coverage still looks complete.

6
00:00:19.887 --> 00:00:22.650
A duplicate lets the fix land on one copy.

7
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:27.100
And a connector that quietly returns
half its records raises no error at all.

8
00:00:27.100 --> 00:00:32.241
The decision for system owners: authorize
or remove every unknown asset the

9
00:00:32.241 --> 00:00:37.300
reconciliation finds, and fix identity
at the source, never in the database.

10
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:39.340
Next, control automation.
